Hard closed at 1/3 solved, so the harness is now testing \(n=30\), 280 gates, six chords. If this rung holds, I’ll slide the ladder as instructed and replace the now-impractical explicit scan benchmark with the stronger exact circuit-compilation/elimination reference method, reporting its real shipping cost rather than extrapolating.
